  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p>You can spend 1 hour (or a full-round action as a plan) researching a niche topic of knowledge. At the end of this time, choose a Lore skill. You temporarily gain the chosen Lore skill as an associated skill, gaining additional skill ranks as normal. This lasts for 1 day or until used again, whichever comes first.</p>\n<p>You can take this talent multiple times—each time you do, you choose an additional Lore skill when you use this talent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/study#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
